<title>UK: B.A.T sinks, tracking Philip Morris drop.</title>
<headline>B.A.T sinks, tracking Philip Morris drop.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in B.A.T Industries Plc sank more than three percent on Thursday, outpacing losses in the broad market and tracking sharp losses in Philip Morris Cos Inc shares, dealers said.</p>
<p>At 1506 GMT, B.A.T shares lost 15-1/2p to 492, as Philip Morris shares $4-3/4 to $117-1/4.</p>
</text>
